{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "之一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此品施常住五果對此土雜眾"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "之二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此品施勝三修對此土聲聞眾"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此品訖大眾問品隨問而施對此土菩薩眾"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "之三"}
